SUMMARY:ARTbus: Mississauga and Oakville Galleries ($20)
DESCRIPTION:TORONTO ARTS & CULTURE\nCan you join us on our next ARTbus ?? 
 !!\n\nWe've been attending these **ARTbus** trips for many years. Not alwa
 ys able to get them posted on MEETUP-as they fill up quite quickly.\n\n$20
  ticket link is below.\n\n***Purchase your OWN ticket*** when you RSVP on 
 Meetup.\n\n**In partnership with the Art Gallery of Mississauga\, Oakville
  Galleries invites you to join us for the FALL 2026 ARTbus.**\n\n(We rent 
 a BUS--ok its a **yellow school bus**--but it works!) Hence the $20 price!
 \n\n**$20 per person** at the *link below. (By signing up--signals to me t
 hat you've purchased your $20 ticket--LET me know via Meetup email)*\n\nWo
 uld you like to join in this next one/upcoming? **Saturday October 24th. (
 11am-5:30pm)**\n\nThis will be incredible afternoon!! International artist
 s. Lovely reception and opening comments.\n\n**We'll begin** the afternoon
  at a Gallery opening at Bloor/Lansdowne\, before heading to Mississauga a
 nd Oakville\n\nLet someone else DRIVE while we enjoy socializing and ART l
 earning.\n\n**Reserve your own seat ($20)** and enjoy an inspiring afterno
 on across three leading art institutions.\n\nWe finish the day at Gairloch
  Gardens--(right on Lake Ontario) and a nice reception for us (wine/cheese
 )\n\nhttps://www.oakvillegalleries.com/visit\n\n**TICKET link here (with a
 ll details)--**\n\nhttps://www.oakvillegalleries.com/artbus_2026_fall\n\nP
 lease be on TIME. Plan ahead.\n\nYou should be inside the first gallery by
  11:15am. BUS will leave at 12 noon.\n\nSee you there.
