SUMMARY:ART Toronto Visit:  Emerging Collectors Evening ($35)
DESCRIPTION:TORONTO ARTS & CULTURE\nWe attend **ART Toronto** each year--a
 nd always look for an interesting timeslot to enter!!\n\nWe've a ***specia
 l $35 promo*** (includes admission\, drink ticket\, and various tours/talk
 )---only on Friday October 30th (5pm-9pm)\n\nAs we've completed numerous A
 RT Crawls this year\, and various ART trips (past and upcoming)\, I though
 t it made sense to take advantage of the...\n\n***Emerging Collectors Even
 ing*** ($35)\n\n\\*\\*\\*Admission includes Complimentary Drink included o
 n Friday evening only (Non-alcoholic options available)\, DJ sets and spec
 ial programming **on starting an art collection**. Tours and Talk.\n\nPLUS
 --you'll see many galleries we visit on our ART Crawls!\n\n**USE** this ti
 cket link...\n\nhttps://www.tix123.com/tickets/?code=ART26&promo=ATXTC\n\n
 **ENTER** this promo code...**ATXTC (was $45. now $35)**\n\n*Art Fair Entr
 y\, Drink ticket\, talks/tours = Excellent Value for $35.*\n\n**PROGRAMMIN
 G** link is here/details...\n\nhttps://arttoronto.ca/home/daily-programmin
 g/\n\n**IF you enjoy** learning about contemporary ART--and attending FAIR
 S\, then please join us in Montreal (April 2027)\n\nhttps://www.meetup.com
 /toronto-arts-and-culture/events/316594472
