SUMMARY:Citadel Contemporary Dance:  Winterreise
DESCRIPTION:TORONTO ARTS & CULTURE\n### Winterreise\n\n##### Laurence Lemi
 eux & Citadel \\+ Compagnie \\| Echo Chamber\n\nA solitary traveller wande
 rs through a frozen world of memory and longing in this **moving adaptatio
 n of Franz Schubert’s *Winterreise*.** Reimagined for violin\, piano\, a
 nd two voices\, the production intertwines live music and dance to explore
  love\, loss\, and the search for belonging in Schubert’s timeless song 
 cycle.\n\n***Ticket link here: ($35-$45)***\n\n(you're purchasing for the 
 Saturday November 28th--8pm\n\nhttps://www.citadelcie.com/event/winterreis
 e/\n\nMore info on Echo Chamber:\n\nhttps://www.echochambertoronto.com/\n\
 nJoin us for this 'winter journey'!!
